### ==========================================
### 1. CREATE MENTIONS (BUILDING THE GRAPH)
### ==========================================

### Mention 1: Chapter #1 mentions Person #3 ("Jane Doe")
POST {{url}}/mentions
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": 1,
  "ownerType": "CHAPTER",
  "startIndex": 15,
  "endIndex": 23,
  "selectedText": "Jane Doe",
  "targetId": 3,
  "targetType": "PERSON"
}

###

### Mention 2: Chapter #1 ALSO mentions Place #2 ("Central Park")
POST {{url}}/mentions
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": 1,
  "ownerType": "CHAPTER",
  "startIndex": 45,
  "endIndex": 57,
  "selectedText": "Central Park",
  "targetId": 2,
  "targetType": "PLACE"
}

###

### Mention 3: TimeCapsule #1 ALSO mentions Person #3 ("Jane Doe")
POST {{url}}/mentions
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": 1,
  "ownerType": "STORY",
  "startIndex": 10,
  "endIndex": 18,
  "selectedText": "Jane Doe",
  "targetId": 3,
  "targetType": "PERSON"
}

###

### Mention 4: Person #3 ("Jane Doe")'s page mentions Place #2 ("Central Park")
POST {{url}}/mentions
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": 3,
  "ownerType": "PERSON",
  "startIndex": 0,
  "endIndex": 12,
  "selectedText": "Central Park",
  "targetId": 2,
  "targetType": "PLACE"
}

###

### ==========================================
### 2. TEST OUTGOING MENTIONS (Links on a Page)
### ==========================================

### Get Outgoing Mentions for Chapter #1
# Expected Result: Returns 2 mentions (pointing to Person #3 and Place #2)
GET {{url}}/mentions/owner/CHAPTER/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Outgoing Mentions for TimeCapsule #1
# Expected Result: Returns 1 mention (pointing to Person #3)
GET {{url}}/mentions/owner/STORY/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ==========================================
### 3. TEST INCOMING MENTIONS (Backlinks)
### ==========================================

### Get Incoming Mentions for Person #3 ("Jane Doe")
# Expected Result: Returns 2 backlinks (referenced by Chapter #1 and TimeCapsule #1)
GET {{url}}/mentions/target/PERSON/3
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Incoming Mentions for Place #2 ("Central Park")
# Expected Result: Returns 2 backlinks (referenced by Chapter #1 and Person #3)
GET {{url}}/mentions/target/PLACE/2
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ==========================================
### 4. CLEANUP / DELETE
### ==========================================

### Delete Mention #1
DELETE {{url}}/mentions/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json